    "preamble": "Narayan Chandra Paul vs The State Of West Bengal & Anr on 7 December, 2016 Author: Joymalya Bagchi Bench: Joymalya Bagchi 1 164 07.12.2016 rkd Ct. No.28 C.R.R. 3845 of 2016 Narayan Chandra Paul -vs- The State of West Bengal & Anr.",
    "facts": "It is submitted on behalf of the petitioner that the registration of first information report under the provision of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act is unwarranted as the said law stood repealed at the time of commission of alleged offence. It is further submitted that the impugned first information report was registered to circumvent the provision of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 is not maintainable in law.",
